Text Notes 800 9300 0 75 ~ 0
U1 pin 37 is a multiple open-drain output. R12 is required; never connect a speaker/headphone directly.
Text Notes 800 9650 0 75 ~ 0
Leave K0...K5, OCLK, SOD and IRQ open. POT and BCLK contacts can also act as outputs.
Text Notes 800 10000 0 75 ~ 0
C16 at pins 17/1; ground plane. Keep AUD_RAW short; no extra capacitor on pin 37 (30-pF reference load).
Text Notes 800 10350 0 75 ~ 0
The level-translated bus is write-only. This hardware cannot read RANDOM, POT or IRQ status.
$EndSCHEMATC
